  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2202901",
      "subQuestName": "找到发布委托的朝仓",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220290101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220290101": {
            "id": "220290101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "我一定！我一定要…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290102"
            ]
          },
          "220290102": {
            "id": "220290102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "嗯？你是？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290103"
            ]
          },
          "220290103": {
            "id": "220290103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我接到了你的委托。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290104"
            ]
          },
          "220290104": {
            "id": "220290104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "噢，你说那个陪练委托啊，没错，是我发布的，我想找个人来和我对练武艺。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290105"
            ]
          },
          "220290105": {
            "id": "220290105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "你把我的委托给接下了吗？但我之前好像没有在城里见过你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290106"
            ]
          },
          "220290106": {
            "id": "220290106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "抱歉，我不是质疑你的实力。但我确实不知道你的武艺如何…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290108",
              "220290110"
            ]
          },
          "220290108": {
            "id": "220290108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "哈哈哈…真的吗？其实我更好奇你是在哪里找到巨龙的，我也只是听说过而已…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290112"
            ]
          },
          "220290112": {
            "id": "220290112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我还是很能打的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290113"
            ]
          },
          "220290113": {
            "id": "220290113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "哈哈，无论如何，武艺这种事情都是口说无凭，我们还是手上见真章吧。"
          },
          "220290110": {
            "id": "220290110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "欸，你看你说的，你肯定是在璃月那边参与过「请仙典仪」吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290111"
            ]
          },
          "220290111": {
            "id": "220290111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "哈哈哈，照你这么说，璃月那边有很多人都「见证过神陨」了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202904",
      "subQuestName": "与朝仓对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220290401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220290401": {
            "id": "220290401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "放马过来吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290601"
            ]
          },
          "220290601": {
            "id": "220290601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "刀枪无眼，请小心了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202902",
      "subQuestName": "完成与朝仓的对练",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220290201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220290201": {
            "id": "220290201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "您刚才是留手了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290202"
            ]
          },
          "220290202": {
            "id": "220290202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "不用顾忌我的面子，阁下，请使出全力吧，我…必须要变强才行！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202903",
      "subQuestName": "与朝仓对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220290301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220290301": {
            "id": "220290301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "呼…呼…阁下的武艺，果然高强…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290302"
            ]
          },
          "220290302": {
            "id": "220290302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "在下…在下领教了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290305"
            ]
          },
          "220290305": {
            "id": "220290305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "没…没事，只是需要调整一下气息…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290306"
            ]
          },
          "220290306": {
            "id": "220290306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "但您强大到这种程度，就算是您说您打倒过巨龙我也信…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290307"
            ]
          },
          "220290307": {
            "id": "220290307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "其实我真的打倒过巨龙…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290308"
            ]
          },
          "220290308": {
            "id": "220290308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "哈哈哈…在下当然是相信的。谢谢您和我对练，这场比试，在下铭记在心。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290309"
            ]
          },
          "220290309": {
            "id": "220290309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "如果阁下愿意的话，请以后常来和我对练，有您这样的强者磨砺…我一定能完成那件事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290310"
            ]
          },
          "220290310": {
            "id": "220290310",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那件事？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290311"
            ]
          },
          "220290311": {
            "id": "220290311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "咳…只是我的一点小心愿而已，这次谢谢您了，这些报酬请收下吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290312"
            ]
          },
          "220290312": {
            "id": "220290312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "我还要回去休息一下，您…您的那些招数，力道可真是太足了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202905",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220290501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220290501": {
            "id": "220290501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我还要准备一下。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220290502"
            ]
          },
          "220290502": {
            "id": "220290502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "嗯，准备好了和我说一声就行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202906",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220290602"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220290602": {
            "id": "220290602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "所以，你准备好了吗?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2202911",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220291101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220291101": {
            "id": "220291101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "朝仓",
            "text": "握紧武器，我要攻来了！"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}